{"step_index":108,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T21:49:20Z","thinking":"Examining the order-tracking page requirement, the core functionality centers on an interactive map displaying key delivery progress indicators. The map must visualize the restaurant, customer, and delivery partner locations, along with the route and distance metrics. Data availability will determine which distances and estimated arrival times can be calculated.\n\n\nOrder stages and timestamps must be defined to provide progress updates. Genuine live tracking requires a dedicated mobile interface for the driver and secure, authenticated location data transmission. Security protocols are necessary to prevent unauthorized access and to safeguard sensitive information like addresses and contact details.\n\n\nOrder tracking page construction necessitates full navigation and footer elements alongside an order lookup interface, based on the URL. The visual layout will use high-contrast cards, displaying order details and an animated timeline that depicts order stages. A prominent demo label must be displayed to clarify the lack of live GPS data.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Live Order Delivery Tracking – Brew & Bloom Café Haldia.\" />\n  <title>Live Order Tracking | Brew &amp; Bloom Café</title>\n\n  <!-- Google Fonts -->\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;1,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n\n  <!-- Leaflet Map CSS -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css\" integrity=\"sha256-p4NxAoJBhIIN+hmNHrzRCf9tD/miZyoHS5obTRR9BMY=\" crossorigin=\"\" />\n\n  <!-- Stylesheet -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body style=\"background:var(--warm-cream);\">\n\n  <!-- Navbar -->\n  <nav class=\"navbar scrolled\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n    <div class=\"nav-container\">\n      <a href=\"index.html\" class=\"nav-logo\">\n        <span class=\"logo-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">☕</span>\n        <div class=\"logo-text\">\n          <span class=\"logo-name\">Brew &amp; Bloom</span>\n          <span class=\"logo-tagline\">ORDER TRACKING</span>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n\n      <ul class=\"nav-links\" id=\"navLinks\" role=\"list\">\n        <li><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"nav-link\">Home</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"index.html#menu\" class=\"nav-link\">Menu</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"order-tracking.html\" class=\"nav-link active\">Live Tracking</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"driver.html\" class=\"nav-link\">Driver App</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"admin.html\" class=\"nav-link\" style=\"color:var(--golden-yellow);\">Admin Dashboard</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main class=\"tracking-container\">\n\n    <!-- Order Lookup Bar (if user visits directly) -->\n    <div class=\"info-card\" id=\"orderSearchCard\" style=\"margin-bottom:2rem; background:var(--white);\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n        <h3 style=\"margin-bottom:0.5rem; color:var(--forest-green);\">Track Your Order</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size:0.88rem; color:var(--text-muted); margin-bottom:1rem;\">Enter your Order ID (e.g. <code>BNB...</code>) provided on checkout.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; gap:0.75rem; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"manualOrderIdInput\" class=\"form-input\" placeholder=\"Enter Order ID\" style=\"flex:1; min-width:200px;\" />\n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"trackOrderBtn\">Track Now</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Active Tracking Screen -->\n    <div id=\"trackingContentArea\">\n\n      <!-- Header Card with Demo/Live Status -->\n      <div class=\"tracking-header-card\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:1rem;\">\n          <div>\n            <div id=\"trackingModeBadge\" class=\"demo-tracking-pill\">\n              <span>⚠️ DEMO TRACKING — NOT LIVE GPS</span>\n            </div>\n            <h1 class=\"tracking-order-id\" id=\"displayOrderId\">Order #Loading...</h1>\n            <p style=\"color:rgba(255,248,236,0.85); font-size:0.95rem;\" id=\"displayOrderCustomer\">Recipient: --</p>\n            <p style=\"color:rgba(255,248,236,0.75); font-size:0.85rem;\" id=\"displayOrderAddress\">Destination: --</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Demo Controller Simulation buttons -->\n          <div id=\"demoControlsBox\" style=\"background:rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding:1rem; border-radius:var(--radius-md); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--golden-yellow); margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n              🎮 Demo Stage Simulator\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex; gap:0.5rem; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n              <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-golden\" id=\"btnSimulateNextStage\">Advance Stage →</button>\n              <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\" id=\"btnSimulateRide\">Drive Scooter 🛵</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"tracking-eta-box\">\n          <div class=\"eta-item\">\n            <span class=\"eta-val\" id=\"etaMinutesDisplay\">25 mins</span>\n            <span class=\"eta-lbl\">Est. Arrival Time</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"eta-item\">\n            <span class=\"eta-val\" id=\"distanceRemainingDisplay\">2.5 km</span>\n            <span class=\"eta-lbl\">Distance Remaining</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"eta-item\">\n            <span class=\"eta-val\" id=\"distanceTraveledDisplay\">0.0 km</span>\n            <span class=\"eta-lbl\">Distance Covered</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"eta-item\">\n            <span class=\"eta-val\" id=\"orderTotalDisplay\">₹0</span>\n            <span class=\"eta-lbl\">Bill Amount (COD/UPI)</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 6-Stage Timeline Card -->\n      <div class=\"timeline-card\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:1.15rem; color:var(--forest-green); margin-bottom:1rem;\">Delivery Progress</h3>\n        \n        <div class=\"timeline-stages\">\n          <div class=\"timeline-progress-bar\" id=\"timelineProgressBar\" style=\"width: 10%;\"></div>\n\n          <!-- 1 -->\n          <div class=\"stage-item active\" id=\"stage-received\">\n            <div class=\"stage-circle\">1</div>\n            <span class=\"stage-name\">Order Received</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- 2 -->\n          <div class=\"stage-item\" id=\"stage-preparing\">\n            <div class=\"stage-circle\">2</div>\n            <span class=\"stage-name\">Preparing Food</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- 3 -->\n          <div class=\"stage-item\" id=\"stage-ready\">\n            <div class=\"stage-circle\">3</div>\n            <span class=\"stage-name\">Ready for Pickup</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- 4 -->\n          <div class=\"stage-item\" id=\"stage-picked_up\">\n            <div class=\"stage-circle\">4</div>\n            <span class=\"stage-name\">Picked Up</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- 5 -->\n          <div class=\"stage-item\" id=\"stage-out_for_delivery\">\n            <div class=\"stage-circle\">5</div>\n            <span class=\"stage-name\">Out for Delivery</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- 6 -->\n          <div class=\"stage-item\" id=\"stage-delivered\">\n            <div class=\"stage-circle\">6</div>\n            <span class=\"stage-name\">Delivered</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Live Interactive Map Card -->\n      <div class=\"tracking-map-card\">\n        <div class=\"tracking-map-header\">\n          <div style=\"font-weight:700; color:var(--forest-green); font-size:1rem; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.5rem;\">\n            <span>🗺️</span>\n            <span>Live Delivery Route</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"live-indicator\">\n            <span class=\"live-dot\"></span>\n            <span id=\"mapLiveStatusText\">Telemetry Connected</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"liveTrackingMap\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Delivery Partner Card -->\n      <div class=\"driver-info-card\">\n        <div class=\"driver-profile\">\n          <div class=\"driver-avatar\">🛵</div>\n          <div class=\"driver-details\">\n            <h4 id=\"driverNameDisplay\">Subhajit Das</h4>\n            <p id=\"driverVehicleDisplay\">TVS Ntorq 125 · Haldia Fleet Partner</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.75rem; color:#27AE60; font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;\">● Verified Partner · Sanitized Gear</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"display:flex; gap:0.75rem;\">\n          <a href=\"tel:+910000000000\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-forest\" id=\"btnCallDriver\">\n            📞 Call Partner\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-whatsapp whatsapp-order\" data-item=\"my delivery status\" id=\"btnWhatsappDriver\">\n            💬 WhatsApp\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Order Items Summary Accordion -->\n      <div class=\"info-card\" style=\"display:block;\">\n        <h3 style=\"color:var(--forest-green); margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">Items in this Order</h3>\n        <div id=\"trackingItemsList\" style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.5rem;\">\n          <!-- Rendered dynamically -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\" style=\"padding-top:3rem;\">\n    <div class=\"container\" style=\"text-align:center; padding-bottom:2rem;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:0.85rem; color:rgba(255,248,236,0.6);\">&copy; 2026 Brew &amp; Bloom Café, Haldia · Live Telemetry System</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:0.78rem; color:rgba(255,248,236,0.4); margin-top:0.4rem;\">\n        In production with real drivers, GPS coordinates stream live from the <a href=\"driver.html\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">Driver Interface</a> via Supabase Realtime.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <!-- Leaflet Map JS -->\n  <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js\" integrity=\"sha256-20nQCchB9co0qIjJZRGuk2/Z9VM+kNiyxNV1lvTlZBo=\" crossorigin=\"\"></script>\n\n  <!-- Supabase JS CDN (v2) -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2\"></script>\n\n  <!-- Order Tracking Script Module -->\n  <script type=\"module\">\n    import CONFIG from './js/config.js';\n    import { initSupabase, getOrder, subscribeToDriverLocation, DEMO_MODE, updateOrderStatus } from './js/supabase-client.js';\n\n    const STAGES = [\n      'received',\n      'preparing',\n      'ready',\n      'picked_up',\n      'out_for_delivery',\n      'delivered'\n    ];\n\n    let currentOrder = null;\n    let trackingMap = null;\n    let cafeMarker = null;\n    let userMarker = null;\n    let driverMarker = null;\n    let routePolyline = null;\n    let driverAnimationTimer = null;\n    let driverProgress = 0.2; // 20% along route\n\n    async function init() {\n      await initSupabase();\n\n      const urlParams = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n      let orderId = urlParams.get('orderId');\n\n      if (!orderId) {\n        // Check localStorage demo orders for most recent\n        const raw = localStorage.getItem('bnb_demo_orders_v2');\n        if (raw) {\n          try {\n            const list = JSON.parse(raw);\n            if (list && list.length > 0) orderId = list[0].id;\n          } catch {}\n        }\n      }\n\n      if (orderId) {\n        loadOrder(orderId);\n      } else {\n        document.getElementById('displayOrderId').textContent = 'No Order Selected';\n        document.getElementById('displayOrderCustomer').textContent = 'Please enter an Order ID above to track your food.';\n      }\n\n      document.getElementById('trackOrderBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        const inp = document.getElementById('manualOrderIdInput')?.value.trim();\n        if (inp) {\n          window.location.href = `order-tracking.html?orderId=${inp}`;\n        }\n      });\n\n      // Demo stage controls\n      document.getElementById('btnSimulateNextStage')?.addEventListener('click', advanceDemoStage);\n      document.getElementById('btnSimulateRide')?.addEventListener('click', startScooterSimulation);\n    }\n\n    async function loadOrder(orderId) {\n      try {\n        currentOrder = await getOrder(orderId);\n      } catch (err) {\n        console.error(err);\n      }\n\n      if (!currentOrder) {\n        document.getElementById('displayOrderId').textContent = 'Order Not Found';\n        document.getElementById('displayOrderCustomer').textContent = `Could not find order #${orderId}. Please check the ID.`;\n        return;\n      }\n\n      // Populate details\n      document.getElementById('displayOrderId').textContent = `Order #${currentOrder.id}`;\n      document.getElementById('displayOrderCustomer').textContent = `Customer: ${currentOrder.customer_name} (${currentOrder.customer_phone})`;\n      document.getElementById('displayOrderAddress').textContent = `Delivery To: ${currentOrder.delivery_address}`;\n      document.getElementById('orderTotalDisplay').textContent = `₹${currentOrder.total_amount}`;\n      document.getElementById('distanceRemainingDisplay').textContent = `${currentOrder.customer_distance_km || 2.5} km`;\n\n      const badge = document.getElementById('trackingModeBadge');\n      if (badge) {\n        if (currentOrder.is_demo || DEMO_MODE) {\n          badge.className = 'demo-tracking-pill';\n          badge.textContent = '⚠️ DEMO TRACKING — NOT LIVE GPS';\n        } else {\n          badge.className = 'demo-tracking-pill';\n          badge.style.background = '#27AE60';\n          badge.style.color = '#FFF';\n          badge.textContent = '🟢 LIVE GPS TELEMETRY ACTIVE';\n          document.getElementById('demoControlsBox').style.display = 'none';\n        }\n      }\n\n      // Render items list\n      const itemsList = document.getElementById('trackingItemsList');\n      if (itemsList && currentOrder.items) {\n        itemsList.innerHTML = currentOrder.items.map(i => `\n          <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:0.9rem; padding:0.4rem 0; border-bottom:1px dashed var(--border-light);\">\n            <span>${i.emoji || '🍽️'} <strong>${i.name}</strong> × ${i.qty}</span>\n            <span>₹${i.price * i.qty}</span>\n          </div>\n        `).join('');\n      }\n\n      updateTimeline(currentOrder.status || 'received');\n      initMap(currentOrder);\n\n      // Subscribe to real driver updates if not demo\n      if (!currentOrder.is_demo && !DEMO_MODE) {\n        subscribeToDriverLocation(currentOrder.id, (loc) => {\n          if (driverMarker) {\n            driverMarker.setLatLng([loc.lat, loc.lng]);\n          }\n        });\n      }\n    }\n\n    function updateTimeline(status) {\n      const idx = STAGES.indexOf(status);\n      const safeIdx = idx === -1 ? 0 : idx;\n\n      STAGES.forEach((st, i) => {\n        const el = document.getElementById(`stage-${st}`);\n        if (!el) return;\n        el.classList.remove('active', 'completed');\n        if (i < safeIdx) el.classList.add('completed');\n        else if (i === safeIdx) el.classList.add('active');\n      });\n\n      const progressBar = document.getElementById('timelineProgressBar');\n      if (progressBar) {\n        const percent = Math.min(100, Math.max(10, Math.round((safeIdx / (STAGES.length - 1)) * 100)));\n        progressBar.style.width = `${percent}%`;\n      }\n    }\n\n    function initMap(order) {\n      if (typeof L === 'undefined') return;\n\n      const cafeLat = CONFIG.restaurant.lat;\n      const cafeLng = CONFIG.restaurant.lng;\n      const userLat = order.customer_lat || (cafeLat + 0.018);\n      const userLng = order.customer_lng || (cafeLng + 0.015);\n\n      trackingMap = L.map('liveTrackingMap').setView([cafeLat, cafeLng], 13);\n\n      L.tileLayer(CONFIG.map.tileUrl, {\n        attribution: CONFIG.map.tileAttribution,\n        maxZoom: 18,\n      }).addTo(trackingMap);\n\n      // Café Pin\n      const cafeIcon = L.divIcon({\n        className: 'custom-leaflet-marker',\n        html: '<div style=\"background:#073B32; color:#FFF8EC; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:100px; font-weight:800; font-size:12px; border:2px solid #FFC247; box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);\">☕ Brew & Bloom</div>',\n        iconSize: [115, 32],\n        iconAnchor: [57, 16],\n      });\n      cafeMarker = L.marker([cafeLat, cafeLng], { icon: cafeIcon })\n        .addTo(trackingMap)\n        .bindPopup('<b>Brew & Bloom Café</b><br />Kitchen & Roastry, Haldia');\n\n      // Customer Pin\n      const userIcon = L.divIcon({\n        className: 'custom-leaflet-marker',\n        html: '<div style=\"background:#FF7629; color:#FFFFFF; width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:18px; border:3px solid #FFFFFF; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\">📍</div>',\n        iconSize: [36, 36],\n        iconAnchor: [18, 18],\n      });\n      userMarker = L.marker([userLat, userLng], { icon: userIcon })\n        .addTo(trackingMap)\n        .bindPopup(`<b>Delivery Destination</b><br />${order.delivery_address}`);\n\n      // Route Polyline\n      const startCoord = [cafeLat, cafeLng];\n      const endCoord = [userLat, userLng];\n\n      routePolyline = L.polyline([startCoord, endCoord], {\n        color: '#FF7629',\n        weight: 4,\n        dashArray: '8, 8',\n        opacity: 0.85\n      }).addTo(trackingMap);\n\n      // Driver Scooter Marker (starting ~30% along the path)\n      const driverLat = cafeLat + (userLat - cafeLat) * driverProgress;\n      const driverLng = cafeLng + (userLng - cafeLng) * driverProgress;\n\n      const scooterIcon = L.divIcon({\n        className: 'custom-leaflet-marker',\n        html: '<div style=\"background:#FFC247; color:#172421; width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:22px; border:3px solid #073B32; box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); animation:pulse 1.8s infinite;\">🛵</div>',\n        iconSize: [40, 40],\n        iconAnchor: [20, 20],\n      });\n\n      driverMarker = L.marker([driverLat, driverLng], { icon: scooterIcon })\n        .addTo(trackingMap)\n        .bindPopup('<b>Subhajit Das</b><br />Brew & Bloom Delivery Fleet');\n\n      trackingMap.fitBounds([startCoord, endCoord], { padding: [50, 50] });\n    }\n\n    async function advanceDemoStage() {\n      if (!currentOrder) return;\n      const currentIdx = STAGES.indexOf(currentOrder.status || 'received');\n      const nextIdx = (currentIdx + 1) % STAGES.length;\n      const nextStatus = STAGES[nextIdx];\n\n      currentOrder.status = nextStatus;\n      await updateOrderStatus(currentOrder.id, nextStatus);\n      updateTimeline(nextStatus);\n    }\n\n    function startScooterSimulation() {\n      if (!currentOrder || !trackingMap || !driverMarker) return;\n      if (driverAnimationTimer) {\n        clearInterval(driverAnimationTimer);\n        driverAnimationTimer = null;\n        document.getElementById('btnSimulateRide').textContent = 'Drive Scooter 🛵';\n        return;\n      }\n\n      document.getElementById('btnSimulateRide').textContent = 'Pause Ride ⏸️';\n\n      const cafeLat = CONFIG.restaurant.lat;\n      const cafeLng = CONFIG.restaurant.lng;\n      const userLat = currentOrder.customer_lat || (cafeLat + 0.018);\n      const userLng = currentOrder.customer_lng || (cafeLng + 0.015);\n      const totalDist = currentOrder.customer_distance_km || 2.5;\n\n      driverAnimationTimer = setInterval(() => {\n        driverProgress += 0.02;\n        if (driverProgress >= 1.0) {\n          driverProgress = 1.0;\n          clearInterval(driverAnimationTimer);\n          driverAnimationTimer = null;\n          document.getElementById('btnSimulateRide').textContent = 'Drive Scooter 🛵';\n          currentOrder.status = 'delivered';\n          updateOrderStatus(currentOrder.id, 'delivered');\n          updateTimeline('delivered');\n        }\n\n        const lat = cafeLat + (userLat - cafeLat) * driverProgress;\n        const lng = cafeLng + (userLng - cafeLng) * driverProgress;\n        driverMarker.setLatLng([lat, lng]);\n\n        const distCovered = Math.round(totalDist * driverProgress * 10) / 10;\n        const distLeft = Math.round((totalDist - distCovered) * 10) / 10;\n        const etaMins = Math.max(2, Math.round(distLeft * 3));\n\n        document.getElementById('distanceTraveledDisplay').textContent = `${distCovered} km`;\n        document.getElementById('distanceRemainingDisplay').textContent = `${distLeft} km`;\n        document.getElementById('etaMinutesDisplay').textContent = `${etaMins} mins`;\n      }, 1000);\n    }\n\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init);\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Dedicated Live Order Tracking page with interactive Leaflet map, 6-stage status timeline, driver telemetry support, and simulated demo mode with clear disclaimers.","Overwrite":false,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Lenovo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\brew-and-bloom\\order-tracking.html","toolAction":"Creating order-tracking.html","toolSummary":"Live order tracking page"}}]}
